  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut the corn cob in half. Thickly slice the tomato.\n• Thinly slice the brown onion. Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e5dee421514f116dce2d/step-86dbf36c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Add the onion and cook, stirring often, until softened, 5-6 minutes. Add the balsamic vinegar, water and brown sugar and mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e5dee421514f116dce2d/step-ae484092.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice the haloumi horizontally to get 1 thin piece per person. In a shallow bowl, add the plain flour.\n• In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, place the panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip the haloumi slices into the flour mixture, followed by the egg and finally in the panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate. Wipe out the frying pan and return to a medium-high heat with enough oil to coat the base. Cook the haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. Set aside on a plate lined with paper towel.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e5dee421514f116dce2d/step-03aef1b3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the haloumi is cooking, cook the corn in the boiling water until tender and bright yellow, 5 minutes. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e5dee421514f116dce2d/step-8e54eb68.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave the bake-at-home burger buns on a plate, 1 minute. Cut the buns in half. Wipe out the frying pan and return to a medium-high heat. Add the buns, cut-side down, and toast until golden, 3-4 minutes.\n• TIP: If you prefer, you can bake the buns in a 220°C/200°C fan-forced oven until heated through, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e5dee421514f116dce2d/step-b3267b9a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Build your burgers by spreading a layer of smokey aioli over the base of a bun. Top with the mixed salad leaves, haloumi, caramelised onion and tomato. Serve with the corn cobs (spread with a little butter if you like!).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e5dee421514f116dce2d/step-4541ae2d.jpg"
    }
  ]
